<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I am an attorney with National Funding. We sent you a legal demand and have not heard back from you. In light of the COVID-19 pandemic, we have additional payment options that we can offer to get you back on track and avoid litigation. Please email or call me as soon as possible to discuss as if we do not hear from you we will move forward with preparing the lawsuit.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
